    "id": "event-eic-life-conference-dimapur",
    "title": "EIC LIFE Conference – Dimapur",
    "slug": "eic-life-conference-dimapur",
    "shortDescription": "Equip Indian Churches (EIC) is having its first regional conference for the church in Dimapur. We hope to have a follow-up conference each year. By God’s grace, we are hoping to meet and think about EIC LIFE Conference.",
    "fullDescription": "<p>Equip Indian Churches (EIC) is having its first regional conference in <strong>Dimapur</strong> on the 11th February 2025.</p>\n<p>At the EIC LIFE Conference, we will meet and think about basics of the Christian Life. We hope that this one-day conference would be a time of fellowship and encouragement to Churches and Christians in and around <strong>Dimapur</strong>.</p>\n<p>So, if you live in or around <strong>Dimapur</strong>, we request you to join us and to come and be encouraged, and from God&#8217;s Word. The speakers are pastors of local churches from different parts of India who have a deep desire to help fellow believers and pastors around the country to have a better and Biblical understanding of the Christian life.</p>\n<p>This event would be a great opportunity to sit under God&#8217;s Word, make friends, and network with like-minded brothers and sisters from your city and neighbouring cities.</p>\n<p><strong>Topics</strong><br />\n1. Faith: What do we believe?<br />\n2. Life: How do we live?<br />\n3. Community: Where should we belong?<br />\n4. Growth: How do Christians mature and multiply?<br />\n5. Hope: What are we living for?<br />\nPanel discussion/Q&amp;A</p>\n",
    "featuredPosterUrl": "https://admin.equipindianchurches.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/EIC-LIFE-Conference-Dimapur-2025.png",
