    "shortDescription": "Topic: Pastoring Through Song Equip Indian Churches is organising an online meeting for Pastors, Elders, Pastoral Interns, Seminary Students, Worship Leaders, and Lay Members on the topic &#8220;Pastoring Through Song” b",
    "fullDescription": "\r\n\r\n<strong>Topic:</strong> Pastoring Through Song\r\n\r\nEquip Indian Churches is organising an online meeting for Pastors, Elders, Pastoral Interns, Seminary Students, Worship Leaders, and Lay Members on the topic &#8220;<strong>Pastoring Through Song</strong>” by Bro. Bob Kauflin\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPastoral ministry has multiple aspects, and pastors are often juggling their attention between various responsibilities. It is understandable that preaching and counselling take up a lot of time and attention, but what role should pastors have in the singing ministry of their church? Do pastors consider singing as a part of their teaching ministry to build up the people of God? In this session, Pastor Bob Kauflin will help us think about the importance of “Pastoring through song.”\r\n\r\n",
