    "id": "event-healthy-churches-conference-bengaluru-2023",
    "title": "Healthy Churches Conference – Bengaluru 2023",
    "slug": "healthy-churches-conference-bengaluru-2023",
    "shortDescription": "Equip Indian Churches (EIC) is having its first regional conference for the church in Bengaluru. By God’s grace, we are hoping to meet and think about Biblical Church Growth. We are hoping that this one-day conference wo",
    "fullDescription": "<p>Equip Indian Churches (EIC) is having its first regional conference for the church in Bengaluru. By God’s grace, we are hoping to meet and think about Biblical Church Growth.</p>\n<p>We are hoping that this one-day conference would encourage our brothers and sisters in Bengaluru who are committed to the preaching of the Gospel of our Lord Jesus Christ and desire to grow in their understanding of the church.</p>\n<p>Given the current circumstances, when so many voices are calling out to get our attention to adopt various models of Church Growth; the Church in Bengaluru needs a clear, robust, and biblical understanding of Ecclesiology (The Study of Church) so that our churches can be faithful and rooted in Scripture as we also enjoy true Biblical growth.</p>\n<p>Dear friends, if you live in Bengaluru or are close to Bengaluru, then please take some time out from your busy schedules to come and be encouraged, challenged, and equipped by men who are engaged in serving the church in the various parts of the country. All these men are committed to the ministry of the local church and also have a deep desire to help fellow believers and pastors around the country to have a stronger, biblical understanding of the church.</p>\n<p>This event would be a great opportunity to make friends and network with like-minded brothers and sisters in your part of the world.</p>\n",
