    "id": "event-aipc-2020",
    "title": "AIPC 2020",
    "slug": "aipc-2020",
    "shortDescription": "TOPIC &#8211; Spiritual Disciplines Of The Church And The Pastor. Just as spiritual disciplines are essential for the spiritual lives of individual Christians, they are essential for the life of the body of Christ and fo",
    "fullDescription": "<p></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>TOPIC &#8211; </strong>Spiritual Disciplines Of The Church And The Pastor.</p>\r\n<p>Just as spiritual disciplines are essential for the spiritual lives of individual Christians, they are essential for the life of the body of Christ and for the life of pastor. In this conference, pastors are encouraged to think through what a church is and what a church needs to do as it pursues biblical faithfulness. The important areas of prayer and sexual purity in the life of the pastor are also covered. Additionally, lessons will be learnt from the example of the puritans in the areas of preaching and worship.</p>\r\n<p>Due to the COVID pandemic, this conference is an online conference, and is also open to church members, in addition to pastors and seminary students.</p>\r\n<p></p>",
